- SpecSync writes observed: check -> state.json, verification.json, verification-attempts.json; check --commit -> same three (materialize + verification commits); review -> review.json, review-attempts.json; finalize -> archive move of the change directory plus accepted-state.json, finalization.json, lesson-bundle.md and the change.md front-matter "state: implementing -> archived". No SpecSync write outside the known bookkeeping set.
